:"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有關「睡眠癱瘓症」的描述，何者正確？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"通常發生在睡眠時的深睡期","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"絕大多數的人會頻繁發生睡眠癱瘓","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"作噩夢時，身體可以自由移動","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"癱瘓現象是人體在睡眠中的保護機制","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人們常常聽到「鬼火」與「鬼壓床」的經驗，請問兩者的共同之處為何？","n":32,"ssz":"............................11.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是鬼魂想要向人世間傳達訊息的一種手段","n":19,"ssz":"...............2..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只有在深度睡眠時期，才可能會發生這種現象","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是人類對未知事物的恐懼感所產生的解釋","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是身體的自我保護，以避免人在黑暗中受傷","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文結論，如果遇到超自然事件時，哪一個選項不符合現代科學的精神？","n":34,"ssz":"....................1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"調整思考，依據科學的角度去解釋異狀","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心理治療，透過專業協助，找到問題的根源","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體檢查，看看是否有腦部或癲癇等疾病","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"敬畏鬼神，常去廟裡收驚、拜拜、保平安","n":18,"ssz":".............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解決科學問題的步驟為(1)提出問題→(2)提出假設→(3)檢驗假設。  以「止癢」為例，請將代號依步驟排出正確的順序。","n":59,"ssz":"..........................................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"乙甲丙","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"乙丙甲","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"甲乙丙","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"丙乙甲","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜220字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"221~250字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞251字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（二    ）開始朗讀，在表格中記錄計時1分鐘的朗讀字數。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以多練幾次。最後一次，找一位同學，請他計時、記錄並簽名！","n":86,"ssz":"......................................................................1..............."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼火通常出現在炎熱的夏天，夜裡趕路的行人經過墳場","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE，在文字層但非 ☑ 字元），PDF p7~p9 全部可見（9 個）","n":58,"ssz":".........................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人們看到難以理解的現象，如鬼火或鬼壓床，常會根據過去的經驗或知識，提出一些可能的解釋，這些解釋在科學歷程裡被稱為假設。但是，假設到底正確嗎？科學探究的方法，絕對不是先相信哪一種說法，而是依照下面的程序追尋真相（請默讀底下1~4的黑體字）。\n1.提出問題：從現場觀察到的現象、找到的線索，而產生的疑問。\n2.提出假設：對問題提出一些可能的答案。\n3.檢驗假設：運用方法、蒐集證據驗證假設的答案是否正確。\n4.提出解答：根據驗證的結果，回答提出的問題。\n特別要說明的是，在「檢驗假設」時，如果蒐集到的證據支持假設，假設就成立了，問題解決！這個程序如底下的科學探究步驟的示意圖。\n但如果證據不支持假設呢？則原來的假設就不成立，探索者必須回頭修正假說或研究問題，如示意圖下方、指向提出問題及提出假設的兩個箭頭，一直到問題得到合理的解答。","n":364,"ssz":"...................................2............................................1..1..2............................................................................2........................................................................................................1..............................................................................1...2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人們看到難以理解的現象，如鬼火或鬼壓床，常會根據過去的經驗或知識，提出一些可能的解釋，這些解釋在科學歷程裡被稱為假設。但是，假設到底正確嗎？科學探究的方法，絕對不是先相信哪一種說法，而是依照下面的程序追尋真相（請默讀底下1~4的黑體字）。","n":119,"ssz":"...................................2............................................1..1..2...............................