locks[1].content#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（否）證據不支持假設 → 兩個「修正」箭頭分別回頭指向「提出問題」與「提出假設」","n":40,"ssz":"..............1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].placement","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"印在概念說明框下方、「一、鬼火是怎麼回事？」之前（PDF p7 上緣）","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、鬼火是怎麼回事？科學探究的步驟","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在夏天的夜裡，有人在墳場看見黑暗中閃爍飄動的淡藍色或淡綠色的火焰，除了毛骨悚然的感覺之外，他會好奇地：","n":51,"ssz":"...............................................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.提出問題：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「墳場夏夜裡閃爍飄動的藍綠火焰是怎麼回事？」","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"針對這個問題，人們提出了幾個可能的解釋，這些解釋在科學程序裡被稱為【　】。底下是人們提出的幾個假設：","n":50,"ssz":"...1.........1................................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].answers[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假設","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（教師版答案），文字流有此資訊","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.提出假設：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"底下哪一個假設是可以蒐集資料來檢驗真假的？（2選1）","n":26,"ssz":"....1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假設一：鬼火是屍骸腐化後所產生的磷化氫，它很輕、燃點很低，從地底浮起後會自燃起來","n":40,"ssz":"........................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假設二：鬼火是心有不甘的人死後變成的鬼魂，在暗夜的墳場出來，想要抓交替","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.檢驗假設：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)如果「假設一：鬼火就是磷化氫」是真的，這個假設無法解釋哪一個現象？（單選；參考第三段的說明）","n":49,"ssz":".......................1........1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼火會自己燃燒","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼火是藍綠色的","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼火會飄浮","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼火出現在墳場","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)磷化氫燃燒時是明亮的黃光，但鬼火是藍綠光；從這裡看，「假設一：鬼火就是磷化氫」能接受嗎？需要修正嗎？","n":53,"ssz":"....................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"要接受這個假設，不需要修正","n":13,"ssz":"....1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"要拒絕這個假設，需要修正","n":12,"ssz":"....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.１提出新的（修正後的）假設：","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(3)根據課文第三段，有位英國地理學家提出了修正的假設，請問這修正假設的程序是在圖１的什麼地方？（請參照圖1作答；單選）","n":60,"ssz":"............................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"證據支持假設，問題終於得到解決","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"證據支持假設，鬼火是藍綠色的","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"證據不支持原來的假設，回頭修正原來的假設","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"證據不支持原來的假設，回頭修正原來的問題","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.問題解決：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據課文，這個關於「鬼火是怎麼回事」的研究問題，得到解決了嗎？","n":31,"ssz":"......1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"得到解決：鬼火是磷化氫＋沼氣＋空氣","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"未能解決：鬼火仍是個謎","n":11,"ssz":".........1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、小試身手：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請閱讀以下關於「假設與假設檢驗」的案例後，回答相關的問題。","n":29,"ssz":".......................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"15世紀到18世紀的幾百年間，許多在海上長時航行的水手死於壞血病，他們先是牙齦、皮膚出血、到後來會全身出血而亡。當時的醫學對壞血病成因的假設是「瘴氣」——船艙狹小不通風，船員長時在壞空氣裡生活，因此得了壞血病。但是，所有改善船艙空氣的嘗試都無法降低壞血病的出現率。1753年，英國的海軍軍醫林德發現，讓船員吃柑橘類的食物可以治療、預防壞血病，人們才開始相信壞血病不是外來的壞東西引起的，而是身體缺少了某種營養素。但一直到20世紀，科學家才找到這種物質，並稱它為「維他命C」。","n":237,"ssz":"................................................................................................................................................................................1....1.........................2............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「是什麼讓船員得到壞血病？」","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"針對這個問題，早期醫學界提出一個可能的解釋，這些解釋在科學程序裡被稱為【　】。","n":39,"ssz":"...1...........1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[23].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"底下哪一個是早期醫學提出的假設？（2選1）","n":21,"ssz":"....1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[23].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假設一：壞血病是身體缺少某一種營養素而導致的疾病。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[23].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假設二：壞血病是壞空氣所致，船員吸進船艙裡的壞空氣，就生病了。","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)如果『假設二：壞血病是壞空氣所致』是真的，那麼這個假設無法解釋哪一個現象？（單選）","n":44,"ssz":"...........................1........1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].prompt_source_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)如果「如果『假設二：壞血病是壞空氣所致』是真的，那麼這個假設無法解釋哪一個現象？」（單選）","n":48,"ssz":"..............................1........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為什麼長時在海上航行的船員會生病","n":16,"ssz":"1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"改善空氣的嘗試，無法減少壞血病","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[26].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)「改善空氣不能減少壞血病」，從這裡看，「壞血病是壞空氣所致」是正確的嗎？","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[26].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"是正確的，要拒絕這個假設","n":12,"ssz":".........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[26].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"是不正確的，要拒絕這個假設","n":13,"ssz":".1........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[26].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兩個選項都印「要拒絕這個假設」，選項①語意自相矛盾——照原樣抄，見 source_errata_note","n":52,"ssz":".1.........1........................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[27].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.１原來假說未得支持，然後呢？","n":16,"ssz":"........1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[28].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(3)現在知道「改善空氣不能減少壞血病」你是科學探究者，下一步該做什麼呢？請在圖１找到你可以進行的程序？（請參照圖1作答；單選）","n":64,"ssz":".............................1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[28].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拒絕「瘴氣假說」，另提新假說","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[28].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拒絕「瘴氣假說」，放棄這個問題","n":15,"ssz":"............1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[28].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接受「瘴氣假說」，另提新假說","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[28].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接受「瘴氣假說」，放棄這個問題","n":15,"ssz":"............1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎自我檢核","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果你有做到，請在□內打勾。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.我知道，為得到解答，可透過「提出問題→提出假設→檢驗假設」的科學探究程序。","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.我能看出「假設，其實就是對一個研究問題的解釋」。","n":26,"ssz":"................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.我知道，假設不一定正確；假設要有證據支持，才能成立。","n":28,"ssz":".........1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].items[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.我知道，當證據不支持假設時，必須拒絕假設，重提新的假設。","n":30,"ssz":".......................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[29].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原稿無勾選","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"超自然事件","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼火","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼壓床","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:keypoints.header_row.鬼壓床","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鬼 壓 床","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].超自然事件","slug":null,"idx":null,"te